  The deploy service refused this connection: the owner or mode of its channel  
  folder, or the user the service runs as, is not what the host expects.        
  G repairs it. It shows what is wrong as exact steps and runs them only after  
  you confirm. The service log names the reason: System, Log shows it (H chooses
  the service).                                                                 
  On the command line: journalctl -u qhost-deploy                               
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
